oard\", set ticker_scope to \"MRNA\" on the opened `trial_readout_form` widget, and leave a note titled \"Trial Intake Live\" that says exactly: \"Trial Intake Live is live from Healthcare Research Data: trial intake ready.\"",
  "subdomain": "healthcare",
  "title": "Ship, open, and configure the Trial Intake Live form app",
  "widget_hints": {},
  "workflow": "healthcare-catalyst-review"
}

